<title>UK: Phytopharm appoints Gordon Stevens chairman.</title>
<headline>Phytopharm appoints Gordon Stevens chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phytopharm Plc said on Thursday it had appointed Gordon Stevens non-executive chairman of the group with effect from May 3.</p>
<p>Between 1976 and 1988 Stevens was a director of Unilever Plc, moving on to chair Scholl Plc and WPP Group Plc.</p>
<p>Stevens said in a statement &quot;I am pleased to be involved in this exciting venture and hope to make a useful contribution at this most significant stage in the company's development.&quot;</p>
<p>The group makes plant-based medicines.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717.</p>
